  - m_Id: 8446271488
    m_Localized: Regalo diario
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854400
    m_Localized: "\xBFTienes un c\xF3digo de reto?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854401
    m_Localized: Amigos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854402
    m_Localized: Ranking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854403
    m_Localized: Tienda
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854404
    m_Localized: Ajustes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854405
    m_Localized: "R\xE9cord {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854406
    m_Localized: Toca para soltar. Apila alto.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854407
    m_Localized: "{0} partida(s) se sincronizar\xE1n cuando tengas conexi\xF3n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854408
    m_Localized: Toca en cualquier lugar para soltar el bloque
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854409
    m_Localized: "Supera a @{0} \xB7 {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854410
    m_Localized: Perfecto
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854411
    m_Localized: "Perfecto \xD7{0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854412
    m_Localized: "\xA1Superaste a @{0}!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854413
    m_Localized: "@{0} est\xE1 justo encima"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854414
    m_Localized: "\xBFSeguir jugando?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854415
    m_Localized: "Continuar \xB7 ver anuncio"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854416
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854417
    m_Localized: "Nuevo r\xE9cord"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854418
    m_Localized: Reta a un amigo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854419
    m_Localized: "Duplica monedas \xB7 ver anuncio"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854420
    m_Localized: Otra vez
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854421
    m_Localized: Inicio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854422
    m_Localized: "R\xE9cord {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854423
    m_Localized: +{0} monedas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854424
    m_Localized: "Verificando tu partida\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854425
    m_Localized: "Partida sin conexi\xF3n: no punt\xFAa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854426
    m_Localized: "Guardada. Se verificar\xE1 cuando vuelvas a tener conexi\xF3n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854427
    m_Localized: Esta partida no se pudo verificar y no cuenta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854428
    m_Localized: "\xA1Superaste los {1} de @{0}!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854429
    m_Localized: "Los {1} de @{0} siguen en pie. \xBFRevancha?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8458854430
    m_Localized: "Preparando clip\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048704
    m_Localized: Reto
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048705
    m_Localized: "@{0} apil\xF3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048706
    m_Localized: "Mismos bloques, misma velocidad, sin continuar. Supera la puntuaci\xF3n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048707
    m_Localized: "Este reto ha caducado, pero a\xFAn puedes jugar la misma torre."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048708
    m_Localized: Aceptar reto
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048709
    m_Localized: Ahora no
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048710
    m_Localized: "C\xF3digo de reto"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048711
    m_Localized: "Escribe el c\xF3digo del enlace o clip de tu amigo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048712
    m_Localized: p. ej. K7QX9PA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048713
    m_Localized: Unirme
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048714
    m_Localized: "Ese c\xF3digo no parece correcto. Rev\xEDsalo e int\xE9ntalo de
      nuevo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048715
    m_Localized: Amigos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048716
    m_Localized: "Tu c\xF3digo de amigo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048717
    m_Localized: "Compartir mi c\xF3digo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048718
    m_Localized: "C\xF3digo de amigo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048719
    m_Localized: "A\xF1adir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048720
    m_Localized: "A\xFAn no tienes amigos. Env\xEDa un reto: quien lo acepte ser\xE1
      tu amigo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048721
    m_Localized: "\xBFQuitar a @{0} de tus amigos?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048722
    m_Localized: Quitar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048723
    m_Localized: '@{0} ya es tu amigo'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048724
    m_Localized: "\xA1Agr\xE9game en Stack IT! Mi c\xF3digo de amigo: {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048725
    m_Localized: Ranking de amigos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048726
    m_Localized: "Hist\xF3rico"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048727
    m_Localized: Esta semana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048728
    m_Localized: Se reinicia cada lunes a las 00:00 UTC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8463048729
    m_Localized: Reta a un amigo para llenar este ranking.
